sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant A as Atendente
    participant M as Mecanico
    participant API as API NestJS
    participant SO as ServiceOrder<br/>Domain Entity
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>A: Chega com veículo
    A->>API: POST /service-orders<br/>{customerId, vehicleId, mileage}
    API->>SO: create(customerId, vehicleId)
    SO-->>API: status: RECEIVED
    API->>DB: INSERT service_order
    API-->>A: OS #1 criada (RECEIVED)
    A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/mechanic
    API->>DB: UPDATE mechanicId
    API-->>A: Mecânico atribuído

    alt Serviço simples (ex.: troca de óleo)
        A->>API: POST /service-orders/1/estimates
        API->>SO: requestApproval()
        SO-->>API: status: WAITING_APPROVAL
        API->>DB: INSERT estimate + items
        API->>DB: UPDATE status
        API-->>A: Orçamento gerado
    else Serviço complexo (ex.: motor)
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/diagnosis
        API->>SO: startDiagnosis()
        SO-->>API: status: IN_DIAGNOSIS
        API->>DB: UPDATE status
        API-->>A: Diagnóstico iniciado
        M->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/diagnosis
        API->>SO: startDiagnosis()
        SO-->>API: status: IN_DIAGNOSIS
        API-->>M: Diagnóstico em andamento
        M->>API: POST /service-orders/1/estimates
        API->>SO: requestApproval()
        SO-->>API: status: WAITING_APPROVAL
        API->>DB: INSERT estimate + items
        API->>DB: UPDATE status
        API-->>M: Orçamento gerado
    end

    A->>C: Apresenta orçamento

    alt Cliente aprova
        C-->>A: Aprova orçamento
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/start-service
        API->>SO: startService()
        SO-->>API: status: IN_EXECUTION
        API->>DB: UPDATE status
        API-->>A: Serviço em execução
        M->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/finish
        API->>SO: finish(mechanicId)
        SO-->>API: status: FINISHED
        API->>DB: UPDATE status + finishedAt
        API-->>M: Serviço finalizado
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/deliver
        API->>SO: deliverVehicle()
        SO-->>API: status: DELIVERED
        API->>DB: UPDATE status + deliveredAt
        API-->>A: Veículo liberado
        A->>C: Veículo entregue
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/close
        API->>SO: close()
        SO-->>API: status: CLOSED
        API->>DB: UPDATE status + closedAt
        API-->>A: OS encerrada
    else Cliente rejeita
        C-->>A: Rejeita orçamento
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/1/reject
        API->>SO: rejectEstimate()
        SO-->>API: status: IN_DIAGNOSIS
        API->>DB: UPDATE status
        API-->>A: Retorna ao diagnóstico
        Note over A,API: Novo orçamento pode ser gerado<br/>ou veículo liberado sem reparo
    end
